  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Estimate No. 1 EU-PNG Partnership for Good Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The EU-PNG Partnership for Good Governance is implemented in the form of a Sector Reform and Performance Contract (SRPC), consisting of a sector budget support component and a complementary support component.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Overall objective (OO):&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;To promote good governance and respect for the rule of law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Specific Objectives (SO):&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SO 1: Improved integrity, fight against corruption and crime prevention within the Royal Papua New Guinea Constabulary/Police Force;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SO 2: Improved gender-responsive accountability, transparency, efficiency and credibility of the justice system;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SO 3: Improved effectiveness of the Independent Commission against Corruption&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This Programme Estimate is one of the complementary support components with DNPM / NAO-SU. The PE aims at supporting the coordination on all three specific objectives of the FA.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Expected results:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Result 1: Management of the Service Contract towards achievement of its expected results;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Result 2: Support to the overall coordination of the Action.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
